---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="About" description="Learn about the maker behind each handmade piece of pottery.">
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-4 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-stone-800">About</h1>
    <p class="mt-6 leading-relaxed text-stone-600">
      Every piece in this shop is handmade — shaped on the wheel, glazed by hand,
      and fired in a small kiln. No two pieces are exactly alike.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-stone-600">
      I started making pottery as a way to slow down. What began as a hobby
      became a craft I pour myself into every day. I hope these pieces bring a
      little warmth to your home.
    </p>
  </main>
</Base>
